    "Tighten-only baseline for scripts/test-spawn-ratchet.js: the number of UNCLASSIFIED",
    "synchronous child-process call sites each covered file is allowed to carry.",
    "KEYS ARE REPO-RELATIVE PATHS. The ratchet covers the root scripts/ tree AND every",
    "edition tree under plugins/<edition>/scripts/ — the edition walkthroughs are independent",
    "hand-written suites (not edition-sync GENERATED_AGGREGATORS), so a root-only ratchet left",
    "about 30% of the repo free to grow. A file with no row here has an implicit baseline of 0 —",
    "enforcement is default-on and exempt-BY-BASELINE, never an opt-in allowlist.",
    "The ratchet fails only when a measured count EXCEEDS its row. Lowering a number and",
    "committing it is always allowed and is the only maintenance path; raising one is not a fix.",
    "Classify a site instead, with a spawn-class line comment naming one of: cli-contract,",
    "concurrency, crash, environment — or convert it in-process.",
    "Regenerate the measured numbers with: node scripts/test-spawn-ratchet.js --json",
    "Seeded 2026-07-28; re-keyed and extended to the edition trees the same day."
